# Local act uses Podman (DOCKER_HOST via scripts/run-act.sh / make act), not Docker Engine.
#
# act defaults to --network host, which shares the host port namespace with
# skyport-dev's published 10001 mapping and makes Generate keys fail with
# eaddrinuse / swm-ping "Connection error: closed". Use bridge isolation so
# the CI job container can bind SWM_API_PORT (10001) cleanly.
--network bridge
# Jobs without `container:` (e.g. podman_smoke, podman_gpu_ib) need an explicit
# runner image and privileged mode so nested Podman can create containers under
# act. Use the act Ubuntu image (includes Node for JS actions like setup-beam);
# plain ubuntu:24.04 fails Install OTP with "node: not found".
-P ubuntu-24.04=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-24.04
--container-options --privileged
